cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GrowthEvo-Harness in research, please cite this software."
title: "GrowthEvo-Harness"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "GrowthEvo contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jiaweine/GrowthEvo-Harness"
abstract: >-
  Causal reinforcement learning runtime and evaluation harness for incremental
  user growth, with group-aware cross-fitted CATE, safe policy improvement,
  off-policy evaluation, locked real-world benchmark protocols, conformal
  verification, and risk-sensitive planning.
keywords:
  - causal inference
  - reinforcement learning
  - off-policy evaluation
  - uplift modeling
  - safe policy improvement
  - research software
